：人份","readings":[{"term":"인분","audio":"/audio/3e2b35eb9b09f84959e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70759","senseId":"1","lemma":"인분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"cf1d1af8e04e0ab0","term":"삼겹살","zh":"五花肉","audio":"/audio/cf1d1af8e04e0ab0c70e.mp3","entryId":"61847","definition":"肥瘦间隔而成三层的猪胸肉。","pronunciation":["삼겹쌀"]},{"id":"c0ccf82e09f1e873","term":"오","zh":"五","audio":"/audio/c0ccf82e09f1e8734531.mp3","entryId":"31635","definition":"四加一所得的数目。","pronunciation":["오ː"]},{"id":"3e2b35eb9b09f849","term":"인분","zh":"人份","audio":"/audio/3e2b35eb9b09f84959e6.mp3","entryId":"70759","definition":"以人数为基准计算的份量单位。","pronunciation":["인분"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/788bde15f83e869f6da2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.051,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70759","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.7044,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好的，请给我五份五花肉。","承奎的脸上长满了好多痘痘呢。","客人，您要点餐吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好的，请给我五份五花肉。","客人，您要点餐吗？","承奎的脸上长满了好多痘痘呢。"],"answer":0}]}
